    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the professional stuff... i've tried. it's just more things to manage. more appointments, more talking, more 'work' to do just to feel slightly less miserable. i'm just so exhausted by the whole idea of fixing myself. what if there isn't anything left to fix? what if the battery is just dead?",
